# AI agent attack signatures (MIT-licensed subset)
#
# Tier legend:
#   T1 = framework-exclusive and verified to have zero hits on real traffic - deploy these
#   T2 = generic attack semantics (a human attacker sends the same thing) - attack evidence only
#   T3 = generic tooling identifiers / over-broad / dead patterns - excluded from this file
#
# Decision unit is the actor (all requests from one source IP within a time window),
# not the individual request.
#
# Full metadata (source file:line, usage, stability, traffic verdict) is in ../rules.json.
#

